@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "정지\nwatering = false\nrestart_blocked = false" as Stopped
state "운전 중\nwatering = true\nrestart_blocked = false" as Running
state "운전 중, 재시작 차단\nwatering = true\nrestart_blocked = true" as RunBlocked
state "정지, 재시작 차단\nwatering = false\nrestart_blocked = true" as StopBlocked

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Running : 정상 START 켜짐,\n정상 STOP 해제
Stopped --> StopBlocked : 입력 고장 발생
Running --> Stopped : 정상 STOP 누름
Running --> RunBlocked : START 고장,\n정상 STOP 해제
Running --> StopBlocked : STOP 고장, 또는 START\n고장 중 STOP 누름
RunBlocked --> Running : 둘 다 정상,\nSTART 꺼짐, STOP 해제
RunBlocked --> Stopped : 정상 STOP 누름,\n정상 START 꺼짐
RunBlocked --> StopBlocked : STOP 고장, 또는 START가\n켜짐/고장일 때 STOP 누름
StopBlocked --> Stopped : 둘 다 정상, START 꺼짐
@enduml
